              <math id="alg1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{emb'}\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">emb’</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{emb'}\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> compute embedding of <span id="alg1.4.13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">e’</span> ;
