<div id="lstnumberx57" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx57.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">3.<span id="lstnumberx57.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span></span>Assess<span id="lstnumberx57.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>whether<span id="lstnumberx57.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx57.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>description<span id="lstnumberx57.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>of<span id="lstnumberx57.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx57.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>actual<span id="lstnumberx57.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>output<span id="lstnumberx57.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>knowledge<span id="lstnumberx57.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>graph<span id="lstnumberx57.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>semantically<span id="lstnumberx57.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>captures<span id="lstnumberx57.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx57.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>same<span id="lstnumberx57.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>information<span id="lstnumberx57.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>as<span id="lstnumberx57.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx57.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>log<span id="lstnumberx57.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>event’s<span id="lstnumberx57.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>description.<span id="lstnumberx57.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Check<span id="lstnumberx57.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>for:
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx58" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx58.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">    </span><span id="lstnumberx58.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">-<span id="lstnumberx58.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span></span>Coverage:<span id="lstnumberx58.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Are<span id="lstnumberx58.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>all<span id="lstnumberx58.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>key<span id="lstnumberx58.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>elements<span id="lstnumberx58.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>from<span id="lstnumberx58.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx58.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>log<span id="lstnumberx58.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>event<span id="lstnumberx58.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>present?
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx59" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx59.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">    </span><span id="lstnumberx59.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">-<span id="lstnumberx59.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span></span>Correctness:<span id="lstnumberx59.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Are<span id="lstnumberx59.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>entities,<span id="lstnumberx59.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>actions,<span id="lstnumberx59.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>and<span id="lstnumberx59.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>relationships<span id="lstnumberx59.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>represented<span id="lstnumberx59.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>accurately?
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx60" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx60.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">    </span><span id="lstnumberx60.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">-<span id="lstnumberx60.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_medium" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span></span>Relevance:<span id="lstnumberx60.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Are<span id="lstnumberx60.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>any<span id="lstnumberx60.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>additional<span id="lstnumberx60.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>nodes<span id="lstnumberx60.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>or<span id="lstnumberx60.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>relationships<span id="lstnumberx60.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>relevant<span id="lstnumberx60.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>to<span id="lstnumberx60.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx60.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>log<span id="lstnumberx60.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>event<span id="lstnumberx60.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>context?
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx61" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx62" class="ltx_listingline">It<span id="lstnumberx62.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>is<span id="lstnumberx62.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>acceptable<span id="lstnumberx62.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>if<span id="lstnumberx62.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx62.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>graph<span id="lstnumberx62.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>contains<span id="lstnumberx62.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>more<span id="lstnumberx62.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>information<span id="lstnumberx62.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>than<span id="lstnumberx62.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx62.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>log<span id="lstnumberx62.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>event,<span id="lstnumberx62.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>as<span id="lstnumberx62.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>long<span id="lstnumberx62.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>as<span id="lstnumberx62.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx62.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>information<span id="lstnumberx62.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>isn’t<span id="lstnumberx62.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>contradicting.
</div>
</div>
