<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Results of ablation study of OntoLogX across metrics and <span title="Large Language Model" class="ltx_glossaryref">LLMs</span>. Reasoning models are highlighted with an asterisk before their name. Best values for precision, recall, F1 score, entity linking accuracy, and relationship linking accuracy are highlighted with bold text.</figcaption>
